    "It encrypts your servers and identities before they leave this device. You will enter it once on each of your devices. It cannot be recovered if you forget it.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It encrypts your servers and identities before they leave this device. You will enter it once on each of your devices. It cannot be recovered if you forget it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它会在服务器和身份凭据离开此设备前加密它们。你需要在每台设备上输入一次。忘记后无法找回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is cleared on this Mac only; with iCloud sync, other Macs keep theirs.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
