          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅清除此 Mac 上的记录；若开启 iCloud 同步，其他 Mac 仍保留各自记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its live load, CPU, memory, disk and traffic show here, and it opens a terminal or files in one click.": {
