    "Tamio collects zero analytics, zero crash tracking, and zero advertising telemetry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio collects zero analytics, zero crash tracking, and zero advertising telemetry."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio は分析データ、クラッシュ追跡、広告テレメトリを一切収集しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio는 분석 데이터, 충돌 추적 및 광고 원격 측정을 전혀 수집하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio 不收集任何用户行为分析、崩溃追踪或广告遥测数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio 不收集任何使用者行為分析、當機追蹤或廣告遙測資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tamio could not read its key from the keychain, so nothing is saved or synced.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio could not read its key from the keychain, so nothing is saved or synced."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio 无法从钥匙串读取其密钥，因此不会保存或同步任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tamio couldn't read its key from your keychain. Quit Tamio, open it again, and click Allow when asked.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio couldn't read its key from your keychain. Quit Tamio, open it again, and click Allow when asked."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio 无法从钥匙串读取密钥。请退出并重新打开 Tamio，然后在提示时点击“允许”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tamio does not forward the SSH agent, add keys to it, or read keys from the macOS keychain.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio does not forward the SSH agent, add keys to it, or read keys from the macOS keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio 不会转发 SSH 代理、向其添加密钥，也不会从 macOS 钥匙串读取密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tamio does not use the OpenSSH agent, keychain integration or agent forwarding. Choose a stored credential or explicitly import a key.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio does not use the OpenSSH agent, keychain integration or agent forwarding. Choose a stored credential or explicitly import a key."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio 不使用 OpenSSH 代理、钥匙串集成或代理转发。请选择已有凭据或明确导入密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tamio is a native SSH client and AI-powered server operations hub for iOS, iPadOS, and macOS—combining a GPU-accelerated Ghostty terminal, agentless live telemetry with animated charts, concurrent SFTP, end-to-end encrypted iCloud sync, and an in-app AI Fleet Assistant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio is a native SSH client and AI-powered server operations hub for iOS, iPadOS, and macOS—combining a GPU-accelerated Ghostty terminal, agentless live telemetry with animated charts, concurrent SFTP, end-to-end encrypted iCloud sync, and an in-app AI Fleet Assistant."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio は iOS・iPadOS・macOS 向けのネイティブ SSH クライアント兼 AI サーバー運用ハブです。GPU 加速 Ghostty ターミナル、エージェントレスのライブ監視＆アニメーションチャート、並列 SFTP、E2EE iCloud 同期、内蔵 AI アシスタントを備えています。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio는 iOS·iPadOS·macOS용 네이티브 SSH 클라이언트이자 AI 서버 운영 허브로, GPU 가속 Ghostty 터미널, 에이전트리스 실시간 모니터링 및 애니메이션 차트, 병렬 SFTP, 종단간 암호화 iCloud 동기화, 내장 AI 어시스턴트를 제공합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio 是一款面向 iOS、iPadOS 与 macOS 的原生 SSH 客户端与 AI 服务器运维中枢，集成了 GPU 加速 Ghostty 终端、无 Agent 实时监控与动态图表、并发 SFTP 文件管理、端到端加密 iCloud 同步以及内置 AI 运维助手。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamio 是一款面向 iOS、iPadOS 與 macOS 的原生 SSH 用戶端與 AI 伺服器維運中樞，整合了 GPU 加速 Ghostty 終端機、無 Agent 即時監控與動態圖表、並行 SFTP 檔案管理、端到端加密 iCloud 同步及內建 AI 維運助手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
