            "value": "你的其他设备会从 iCloud 钥匙串获取它，或要求你输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your servers and identities stay on this device. A device that still syncs will store its own again, so turn sync off there too.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your servers and identities stay on this device. A device that still syncs will store its own again, so turn sync off there too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的服务器和身份凭据会保留在此设备上。仍在同步的设备会重新存储它自己的数据，因此也请在那里关闭同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your SSH credentials, private keys, and AI API keys stay strictly in your device Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your SSH credentials, private keys, and AI API keys stay strictly in your device Keychain."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 認証情報、秘密鍵、AI API キーはすべてデバイスのキーチェーン内に安全に保管されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 자격 증명, 개인 키 및 AI API 키는 모두 기기의 키체인에 안전하게 저장됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 SSH 凭据、私钥与 AI API Key 均严格保存在本机钥匙串中。"
